    "detailed_description": "Lots of cuteness and mess! That's exactly what you get for having several kittens at home.<br><br>Kittens and Yarn is a cute and minimalist puzzle game where it's up to you to untangle the yarns by simply swapping the pieces.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644840/extras/afb8d800a96787daa41fd706ce91f1cc.poster.avif?t=1748014176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644840/extras/afb8d800a96787daa41fd706ce91f1cc.webm?t=1748014176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644840/extras/afb8d800a96787daa41fd706ce91f1cc.mp4?t=1748014176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Relaxing</strong> - No scoring, no timer, and no pressure. Solve the puzzles in your own time and enjoy the game experience.<br></li><li><strong>Simple control</strong> - You can play by just clicking on the pieces with the left mouse button.<br></li><li><strong>Level progression</strong> - Unique levels, where the challenge increases with each level with more pieces and yarns.<br></li><li><strong>Great soundtrack</strong> - Music and effects exclusively designed to give you the best experience.</li></ul>",
